er</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">2. If on WiFi — try switching networks</h3>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Sometimes college/office networks block GitHub. Try your <strong>mobile hotspot</strong>.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
