<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Then try pushing again.</p>
<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">4. Check if GitHub is reachable</h3>
