<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Python scripts (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.py</code>)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Notebook files (<code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">.ipynb</code>)</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">requirements.txt</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">README.md</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">✅ Frontend files (HTML, CSS, JS) — without API keys</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">❌ No <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">venv/</code>, <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">model/</code>, <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">dataset/</code>, large files</li>
