A: all the above except parkinson's</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Q: What does the OpenAI integration do in your app?
A: Chatbot for Q&amp;A about results</p><p class="whitespace-pre-wrap break-words">Q: What's your app's frontend built with?
