span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;"> 🧠 Brain Disease Classification App</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span>A deep learning web app that classifies brain diseases from MRI scans using VGG16 and ResNet models, with an AI-powered chatbot for Q&amp;A about results.
</span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222); font-weight: bold;">##</span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;"> 🔍 What It Does</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> Upload a brain MRI scan and get instant disease prediction
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> Detects: Brain Tumor, Alzheimer's Disease, Multiple Sclerosis
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> AI Chatbot (OpenAI GPT) to answer questions about the diagnosis
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222); font-weight: bold;">##</span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;"> 🛠️ Tech Stack</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Frontend:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> HTML, CSS, JavaScript
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Backend:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> Python, Flask
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Deep Learning:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> TensorFlow, Keras (VGG16 + ResNet Fine-Tuned)
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">AI Chatbot:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> OpenAI GPT API
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">-</span><span> </span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Image Processing:</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> OpenCV
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222); font-weight: bold;">##</span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;"> ⚙️ Setup</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">1.</span><span> Clone the repo
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">2.</span><span> Run </span><span class="token token code-snippet code" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">`pip install -r requirements.txt`</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">3.</span><span> Add your OpenAI API key as environment variable </span><span class="token token code-snippet code" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">`OPENAI_API_KEY`</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">4.</span><span> Download the pre-trained model: </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">[</span><span class="token token content" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">Google Drive Link</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">](</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">#</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">)</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token list" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">5.</span><span> Run </span><span class="token token code-snippet code" style="color: rgb(204, 123, 244);">`python app.py`</span><span>
</span></span><span>
</span><span><span></span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222); font-weight: bold;">##</span><span class="token token title" style="color: rgb(244, 123, 133); font-weight: bold;"> 👨‍💻 Author</span><span>
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span class="token token bold content">Kushal Hallikar</span><span class="token token bold" style="color: rgb(211, 215, 222);">**</span><span> — B.E. AI &amp; ML, East West Institute of Technology
</span></span><span><span></span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">[</span><span class="token token content" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">LinkedIn</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">](</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">https://linkedin.com/in/kushalhallikar/</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">)</span><span> | </span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">[</span><span class="token token content" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">GitHub</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">](</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">https://github.com/kushalhallikar-spec</span><span class="token token" style="color: rgb(94, 237, 237);">)</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
