<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Just create the README locally and push it:</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Step 1 — Create README in your project folder</h3>
