<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Here's what you can do instead:</p>
<h3 class="text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold">Option 1 — Save the banner as an image (easiest)</h3>
