<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Right-click the banner I designed above in this chat</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Click <strong>"Save image as"</strong></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Save it as <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">banner.png</code></li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Upload it to your GitHub repo</li>
<li class="font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Add this to your README:</li>
